<title>HONG KONG: Ta Fu declares first final results.</title>
<headline>Ta Fu declares first final results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million US$ unless stated)</p>
<p>Consolidated financial statements</p>
<p>    Shr (U.S. cents)	     1.69	vs  1.12</p>
<p>    Dividend (U.S. cents)	0.327     vs  N/A</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	    9.89 gain vs  4.50 gain</p>
<p>    Net				10.78     vs  7.07</p>
<p>    Turnover			 167.35    vs  119.43</p>
<p>Proforma combined results</p>
<p>    Shr (U.S. cents)	     1.68	vs  1.16</p>
<p>    Dividend (U.S. cents)	0.327     vs  N/A</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	    9.89 gain vs  4.50 gain</p>
<p>    Net				10.75     vs  7.29</p>
<p>    Turnover			 167.35    vs  119.43</p>
<p>    Company name		   Ta Fu International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		    June 16-20</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	     July 7</p>
<p>NOTE - Taiwan-based timber products processor Ta Fu International was listed on the Hong Kong stock exchange on December 27, 1996.  </p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$8.15 million on the valued added tax (VAT) refunded and gain of HK$1.38 million interest income on application monies received from issue of new shares.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
